### ==============================================
### REST Client - Lab 08 Express API Tests
### Extension: REST Client (Huachao Mao)
### ==============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Test Root Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Test About / Health Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/about
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Test Time Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/time
Accept: text/plain

###

### 4. Test API Health (if present)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Test 404 Not Found Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/non-existent-route
Accept: text/plain
